  "article": {
    "images": [],
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Who do you think are the heroes in our lives? Maybe doctors, policemen, firemen and so on. Besides them, I think the people who clean up our rubbish are also great heroes. "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "Thanks to",
            "ref": "v-thanks-to"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " them, our planet is not completely covered in trash."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "My name is Thomas Dambo. I’m a “trash artist” and work with these heroes. My job is to create beauty out of trash. By doing this, I want to show people that trash is not all ugly and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "smelly",
            "ref": "v-smelly"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". We can recycle and use it to create something beautiful and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "valuable",
            "ref": "v-valuable"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "About two months ago, I started a project called “The Future Forest”. More than 700 students, 100 volunteers and many "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "landfill",
            "zh": "垃圾填埋场"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " workers joined the project. Together we collected three tons of plastic waste. Then, we turned it into a colourful plastic forest in Mexico City."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "This 500-square-metre forest is filled with thousands of plastic flowers, trees and animals. Children can come to my workshop to build new plants and animals for the forest. In this way, the forest will keep growing. “The Future Forest” is now "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "on display",
            "ref": "v-on-display"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". People can visit it for the next few months."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "There are many possibilities hidden in the rubbish. Let’s learn to recycle it better and build a brighter future for the world!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "vocabulary": [
      {
